     "&gt; &lt;<a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-WmVWlXM5TN8/U8leawSXY2I/AAAAAAAAAP8/gVkfKTkSEdQ/s1600/mean_small.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-WmVWlXM5TN8/U8leawSXY2I/AAAAAAAAAP8/gVkfKTkSEdQ/s1600/mean_small.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370478080000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Vgo_wEE3U5pR9jWBT93AC\">https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-WmVWlXM5TN8/U8leawSXY2I/AAAAAAAAAP8/gVkfKTkSEdQ/s1600/mean_small.jpeg</a>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; --\r<br>&gt; --\r<br>&gt; You received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing\r<br>&gt; list.\r<br>&gt; Please provide a reproducible example:\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370478080000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ukCQIfH_57bxCkRpoqhvi\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a>\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\r<br>&gt; To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>\r<br>&gt; More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370478080000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EKCPh-9am7Al20PdlKtdz\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a>\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ---\r<br>&gt; You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups\r<br>&gt; &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.\r<br>&gt; To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an\r<br>&gt; email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r<br>&gt; For more